器，输出与辅助并存</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/8cdceedc2aaccc5b806ea337460a8d2d_5023025167813434120.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">断罪影舞的毕业武器，兼顾输出与辅助能力。断罪鹦鹉装备时，可通过必杀技触发武器的团队加伤效果，实现辅助效果。断罪鹦鹉在搭配此武器输出时，面对超限空间克制黑姬麟时也可以获得出色的分数。在记忆战场中雷电女王的鬼凯和真炎幸魂也可以携带此武器进行辅助。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/8cdceedc2aaccc5b806ea337460a8d2d_5023025167813434120.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
